<title>FRANCE: EU raises refund on soft wheat flour exports.</title>
<headline>EU raises refund on soft wheat flour exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the daily refund on exports of soft wheat flour to 20.50 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 17.00 Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
